Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:04.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What if you grew one centimeter every minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.51,0:00:06.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You stand in your living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Something feels strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:10.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your shirt pulls tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your sleeves get short.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:13.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:17.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sixty centimeters taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You no longer fit through the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:21.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:23.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fourteen meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:25.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You tower over the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:28.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your heart could struggle to push blood that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.11,0:00:31.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:33.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your head is in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But your bones can't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:38.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your weight grows much faster than your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:40.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your legs could snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:42.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But here's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:44.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The tallest man ever was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Robert Wadlow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.99,0:00:48.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Two point seven two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.23,0:00:51.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}He needed leg braces just to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:54.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}In nineteen forty, a brace rubbed a small blister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It got infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:58.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}He died at twenty-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:00:59.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.94,0:01:02.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Being huge isn't a superpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:04.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Would you still want to grow?
